# glidescale — all three stops back to back in ONE file (~27s), for hearing the dial move rather
# than comparing files. One pass CONSTANT, then S to ANALOG for a pass, then S to PER OCT for a
# pass. The notes never change; only how much the slide time depends on the distance does.
#   node tools/play.js glidescale script tools/clips/glidescale/04-dial-sweep.script \
#        --headless --frames 1630 --wav /tmp/sweep.wav
# frames 1630
tap 540 S
tap 1080 S
